*[[Sweden men's national football team|Sweden]] advanced to play [[Senegal national football team|Senegal]] (runner-up of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group A|Group A]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Sweden vs Senegal|round of 16]].
*[[England national football team|England]] advanced to play [[Denmark national football team|Denmark]] (winner of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group A|Group A]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Denmark vs England|round of 16]].

